{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8fc120631d61eb5f1c1e2cea4e9d5d59ff75a033c9c30d7dc8e4ffa4a77fcbdd", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 死闘", "zh": "百合之谜 ～天空的小猪～ 死斗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e14a04174118ff48a95bb2e271b5388e9218c561daa8209ac7ad0584c6dc5a1", "ja": "洞窟を抜け、地下迷宮の第一関門にやって来\nた百合子達。立ちはだかる四天王・亜利沙に\n戦いを挑むが、秘奥義を受けピンチに……そ\nの時、星梨花が妖精の衣で奥義を受け止め、\n形勢逆転。次の関門へ進むのだった。", "zh": "穿过洞窟，百合子等人来到了地下迷宫的第一道关卡。\n挡在她们面前的是四天王·亚利沙。她们向其发起挑战，\n却因中了秘奥义而陷入危机……就在这时，星梨花用妖精\n之衣挡住了奥义，扭转了战局。随后，她们向下一道关卡进发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "45392bea020bb1f181d57362bb6da22bc34be90f4f5edf6c153b08b50bac9faa", "ja": "もうずっと歩いてるけど、本当にこの道でいいのかな。\n頭がこんがらがってきちゃった……。", "zh": "虽然已经走了好久，但这条路真的对吗？\n脑子都开始乱成一团了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "91dbd39f758f5b4456a0ad399416191db816c86a683dd5e89c75886534d646eb", "ja": "あっ！　百合子さん、見てください。\nロコさんがいますよ！", "zh": "啊！百合子小姐，快看。\nROCO先生就在那儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "02e6c18c7f5fef1a3406fadcc42b1aa5de64dbb98a9c9b9d83826ff1f662af03", "ja": "ロコは秘密の行商人Aです！　ここではバトルに備えて\nスーパーなアイテムを特別販売中です♪", "zh": "ROCO是秘密行商人A！　这里正在为战斗准备，特别出售超棒的道具♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "6a394328287483748e8c36b0f1b77e544f0811e5fb70344bfde134ea1dc19ab4", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさい。星梨花ちゃんのパパとママに\nもらったアイテムが、まだたくさん残ってて……。", "zh": "啊，对不起。星梨花的爸爸妈妈送给我的道具还剩下很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "382ff345adc9af76a31f8fa874bf3b5a188eea12381e3cd3a8c4796b43c98f5f", "ja": "でもロコさんがいるってことは……。\n百合子さん、この扉の奥に強敵がいるってことです！", "zh": "但是，既然ROCO在这里……百合子，这扇门后面就有强敌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "58ea7163d03376a67c8a8f57882da5a1c23796bb15010350b9d688e33b2c21c2", "ja": "イグザクトリー！", "zh": "没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd06e94d26ba714e8a1a08bf07ce5da46139bea5c0b1eb443f7d8cba9541d635", "ja": "気を引き締めていきましょう。百合子さん！", "zh": "打起精神来吧，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "732e2c64c4cc1e477c8500443cea4a16feb3aa03ebbdad76f23fed78878af95f", "ja": "うん。じゃあ、開けるよ！", "zh": "嗯。那么，我要打开了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1008_se", "source_sha256": "a511139a441668551b8ef02ded4b8d396df901a63e2d6e245b4cbf535241d7c7", "ja": "ギギギギッ……ガシャーン！", "zh": "嘎吱嘎吱……哐当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1009_null", "source_sha256": "690665a0e759a8d096b07877758c77f8713d6866f55e3cbb9b9cdb324f54b37e", "ja": "―　地下迷宮・第一関門　―", "zh": "―　地下迷宫·第一道关卡　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "fcc9d056a5f78421387c446d624f594e42a1661b0f38412b4782a1c6485f90f3", "ja": "フフフ……。よくぞきました勇者ちゃん！\nわれこそは四天王、イベント全通のあり……。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……勇者呀，你来得好！我就是四天王、活动全勤的阿莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1011_se", "source_sha256": "c6af9f13f697a30aeebc02a2f5949b2e512c6b01042b7156ebcfbd7876364c13", "ja": "バンッ！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "281d410411d4c63989e7f685f2110d53765ee3cda466f3318c4c77a3673707ad", "ja": "『ちょ、ちょっと！？　ありさの口上、聞～い～て～\nくださいっ！　頑張って考えたんですよー！？』", "zh": "“等、等一下！？请听听～亚利沙的开场白～！\n这可是我努力想出来的哦——！？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "93f44c2a5e11e760877f8101fe59c9e3a928368b340e59fe98ba52079f296c41", "ja": "なんかあんまり戦いたくない感じ……。", "zh": "总觉得……不太想战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd1033e2359b2385ba1a2dd1bd17d2b21e9cd523184960d26d9de17fc7304ce3", "ja": "でも、ダンジョン最奥に続く扉はここだけです。\n四天王を倒さないと先には進めません。", "zh": "但是，通往地下城最深处的门只有这一扇。\n不打倒四天王，就无法继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "881600ce4a302f9061e1c3f360c6d3d747e67b636158de9a251e1310535ef738", "ja": "……わかりました。\nこれも勇者の責務のうち……ですね。", "zh": "……我明白了。\n这也是勇者的职责所在……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "7012fcba797ec814e40268c66373ab9d0bf56b7e7d2c2485f01d040f45c62e81", "ja": "ムフフ♪　きましたね、勇者ちゃん！　ありさが、\nたっぷりバッチリかわいがってあげちゃいますよーっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 来了呢，勇者小姑娘！亚利沙会好好地、彻彻底底地疼爱你一番哦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "6eb895b5c7b874d4009124c84d16e3fdc1cac869f28b91088ef9c10f04854e07", "ja": "四天王の亜利沙さん……これも世界の平和のためです。\n亜利沙さんを倒して、私達は先に進みます！", "zh": "四天王的亚利沙小姐……这也是为了世界的和平。\n打倒亚利沙小姐之后，我们就会继续前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "7f9adcdf3006638340dd86190b6d506a65e9aed8467fb5d3d611a9fd72b5db2b", "ja": "そうはいきません。ありさは魔王朋花さまに\n忠誠を誓った身。魔王さまの敵はありさの敵なんです！", "zh": "那可不行。亚利沙已经向魔王朋花大人宣誓效忠。魔王大人的敌人，就是亚利沙的敌人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "34ebfbe1becaefa459e6e1e06f2db220c9454f372100f9fa1a095a8e3e224bd1", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、ここで倒してしまうのは惜しいですが、\nありさも本気でいきますよ～！", "zh": "百合子，虽然在这里打倒你很可惜，但亚利沙也要认真上了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "36ff44d7cd6aa7d2c1bf8515c8dad2fe622523ad27941cb92c31e8a12adffa2c", "ja": "はっ、亜利沙さんの握りこぶしの指の隙間から、\n色とりどりの5本の光の棒が！", "zh": "啊，从亚利沙小姐握紧的拳头指缝间，竟然出现了色彩缤纷的5根荧光棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "38d954dccfcbe73b696a27b61ddf147c0ae8cef110bdd1acade855c058f0c37f", "ja": "秘技・ファイブライトフィンガー！！", "zh": "秘技·五光指！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "931dcd8b49f8e12168a40aa5d1afaadfd35069bc1c5af3b771ad59df4fd40aac", "ja": "受け切るっ！　エアロブレードっ！！", "zh": "全部接下来！气流之刃！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1023_se", "source_sha256": "6b2728d9040795022cf81cd776057d8b1aa2a5a505585afee672d4d9d61d5627", "ja": "ガキーンッ！！", "zh": "铛——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f708670b5f122209bf62a24f8439eb522e2d94f6e410bca3abd8c7302b6ffb0", "ja": "さすがは勇者ちゃん……。でも、これで終わりだと\n思ったら大間違いです！　両手を使うことで……。", "zh": "不愧是勇者们……不过，要是以为这样就结束了，那可就大错特错了！用上双手的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "509d70026c5008d5ac6ca9e652b689a3e1c196d20d408b68c84eea75a1e5c980", "ja": "なんと10人の勇者ちゃんを一度に応援、\nいや葬ることができるんです～！", "zh": "竟然能同时给10名勇者加油，不，是把他们葬送掉～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "f67f4d78a59c7364b1746248da51af65cc02f6ca728c85272630f28e518ef47f", "ja": "これで終わりです！\n秘奥義・テンスライトフィンガー！！", "zh": "到此结束了！\n秘奥义·十光指！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "34ea4e0a3d04856c4c878b05502baa81c072d9e4765bf0352e3cd61249e90ec5", "ja": "危ないっ！　きゃあっ！", "zh": "危险！呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1028_se", "source_sha256": "81351cf0df77a7c9db4100100959a0a5917cf9f3dddb50a2dbf74caae34fdd5e", "ja": "シュゥゥゥッッ！", "zh": "咻——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "20c254b047939660b8c905ae2b38c9d3038e7075d6e767e764fe768c7f12ea7b", "ja": "あああっ！？　ありさのライトフィンガーが、飛び込ん\nできた妖精ちゃんの服に吸い込まれちゃいました！？", "zh": "啊啊啊！？亚利沙的轻巧手指，被吸进飞扑进\n来的小妖精的衣服里了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "b6a4b7afd4defe77ab11d4f2df07bdc90c89b48b1f4429f7204ca9836ef0c32e", "ja": "せ、星梨花ちゃん！　大丈夫、星梨花ちゃん！？", "zh": "星梨花！没事吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "aa48a08c3475579b3befc1008a32d27935691fbe287198c7c98994f7c7be6725", "ja": "妖精の衣は魔法の衣……一度くらいは必殺技も受け\n切れます……。百合子さん……あとはお願いしますっ。", "zh": "妖精之衣是魔法之衣……就算挨一次必杀技也\n撑得住的……百合子小姐……接下来就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "8131c313614db04572d617e4f583353b011004ad55d0fae9c79306b5a468904a", "ja": "……わかりました。\n亜利沙さん、覚悟！　エターナル・ブリザード！！", "zh": "……我明白了。\n亚利沙，做好觉悟吧！永恒冰暴！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1033_se", "source_sha256": "f7a4c1c728f21ef06c8e9d832a0ab0d6f0f1233d60fd1cd4a92ecdc30eed4444", "ja": "シャキシャキーンッ！", "zh": "精神抖擞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "4235c72483cd723a0f7da102ad30454f443674baa72bb9e75f7b12dde2c15bf2", "ja": "はええええっ！？　こ、ここでありさを倒してもっ、\n第二第三の刺客が、必ず……。", "zh": "好快快快快！？　就、就算在这里打倒了亚利沙，第二、第三个刺客也一定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "a5b5ef04276dc352408edcccd7ab177c03bbfe82c7b3733d68f56740bd71dc05", "ja": "ひ、ひえ～～～～っ！！", "zh": "呀、呀啊～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "3af3b2b4fb3c4e21c9cf95d0fed60c799261d5531c8d9dae198265614d31f393", "ja": "セリカ、大丈夫ですか！？", "zh": "星梨花，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f3b1cacd2a0faf68770e09352bd7e47cfd95be80a96d044d42373dbf24d627a", "ja": "……星梨花ちゃんの妖精の衣が……\n衣の光が弱くなって、消えていっちゃう……！", "zh": "……星梨花身上的妖精之衣……\n衣服的光芒变弱，正在渐渐消失……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "2fb48a115b28a54a9b0d76700f6edc01a36a0011c2cf04e3743aa0375a5eb151", "ja": "……魔法の力を、使い果たしちゃったみたいですね。\nえへへっ……。", "zh": "……看来是把魔法的力量，都用光了呢。\n诶嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "cb2bb5d766cdb4b555f0a4ece6c6f6b81899694dce07b97af48cb5c6ce1fcb74", "ja": "勇者さんは、わたしたちの希望なんです。だから、\n勇者さんの……百合子さんの役に立てて、よかった。", "zh": "勇者小姐是我们的希望。所以，能帮上勇者……百合子小姐的忙，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "29ba5708ba33fe1e0ed3a38a41680360fa0e881532a847060893b998a24d87aa", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、ごめんね……うっ……ぐすっ……。", "zh": "星梨花，对不起……呜……抽泣……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1041_025roc", "source_sha256": "cf49093b5578f036e72f15cd283c8888398256ceed39ecb576c6ca7960a704bf", "ja": "ユリコ、セリカ……ぐすっ。ふたりとも、\nえらいです～～！　グレイトです……！　……ん？", "zh": "百合子、星梨花……呜呜。你们两个，\n真棒～～！太厉害了……！……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1042_025roc", "source_sha256": "4f128cf923ebd465ad97e92169048cdd2d0d77a968c85783d987e005bad77f81", "ja": "アリサが何か落としていったみたいです。\nポートレート……でしょうか？", "zh": "亚利沙好像落下了什么东西。\n是肖像照……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac43924bc4f77bf5eb62a96df2619f39452c9b8a81a959df74e6bd5394440e85", "ja": "キレイな女の子ですね。\n百合子さんと同い年くらいじゃないですか？", "zh": "是个漂亮的女孩子呢。\n看起来和百合子差不多大吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "dece0ad79d27e9015db553bcce052bdc8233fe0a4bc968c02a7ae5b937293eb4", "ja": "そうかもしれない。\nでも、すごく意思の強そうな女の子。誰なんだろう？", "zh": "也许吧。\n不过，她看起来是个意志非常坚定的女孩。她是谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "ab92f80d59359126abdb0a41cc5c87e030a86243dab596898cb26c4e7456ce69", "ja": "亜利沙さんが倒されてしまったようですね。\n四天王ともあろう者が、だらしのないことです。", "zh": "亚利沙小姐似乎被打倒了呢。身为四天王之一，真是太不像话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "e840b1702c950d0035240f5b540af210530f5462109a582525425ffddeae25dd", "ja": "この失態は、同じ四天王にあがなってもらう\nとしましょう。期待していますよ～？", "zh": "这次的失态，就让同为四天王的你来赔偿吧。可别让我失望哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_04_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "7557357c12bcc676b7f6884a9d3a9f932277d6437b3964de9f2670afde05030e", "ja": "ハッ！", "zh": "遵命！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
